{
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "$id": "https://github.com/phuongnse/nexkit/protocol/v1/calls/prompt.schema.json",
  "$comment": "A prompt call: the prompt of one stage, written from the texts the host fetched for it, by the kinds runAgent names. `texts` is the absolute path, POSIX or Windows, of the folder outside the working tree where the host keeps the whole texts a prompt shortens, which the agent reads; null when it reads no files. With `unfit`, why a session's result did not fit its schema, the answer is the prompt that asks the same session for its result alone. `words` are the host's own words for the work item, the change and where people read, which a stage's prompt needs. Beside the host's policies, `checklist` and `profiles` feed the prompts.",
  "type": "object",
  "required": [
    "protocol",
    "call",
    "state",
    "stage",
    "inputs",
    "policies"
  ],
  "properties": {
    "protocol": {
      "const": 1
    },
    "call": {
      "const": "prompt"
    },
    "state": {
      "$comment": "The fix and review prompts read the earlier fix rounds from `rounds.fixes`, the last review from `rounds.lastReview` and the change's current version from `change.version`; a request without a state, or whose state holds none of them, shows no earlier rounds. The newest fix record is the round a review follows.",
      "anyOf": [
        {
          "$ref": "../state.schema.json"
        },
        {
          "type": "null"
        }
      ]
    },
    "stage": {
      "$ref": "../common.schema.json#/$defs/stage"
    },
    "inputs": {
      "$ref": "#/$defs/inputs"
    },
    "policies": {
      "$comment": "The host's policies, as every call has them, and two that only the prompts read: `checklist`, the items the plan and the review answer, and `profiles`, the profiles triage chooses from, each name with an object whose `when` is a string. A plan needs `budgets.implement.seconds` as an integer, the implement stage's time, which its prompt names; the engine refuses a plan without it, and a profile without a string `when`.",
      "$ref": "../policies.schema.json",
      "properties": {
        "checklist": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "type": "string"
              },
              {
                "type": "object",
                "properties": {
                  "text": {
                    "type": "string"
                  },
                  "person": {
                    "type": "boolean"
                  }
                },
                "required": [
                  "text"
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "profiles": {
          "type": "object"
        }
      }
    },
    "texts": {
      "type": [
        "string",
        "null"
      ]
    },
    "unfit": {
      "type": [
        "string",
        "null"
      ]
    },
    "words": {
      "$ref": "#/$defs/words"
    }
  },
  "$defs": {
    "number": {
      "$comment": "An id as the host shows it to people, such as an issue's number.",
      "type": [
        "string",
        "integer"
      ]
    },
    "inputs": {
      "$comment": "The texts the host fetched, by the kinds that runAgent names (protocol.stages.INPUTS). Every stage needs `item`; implement, fix and review need `plan`, which may be null; fix and review need `diff`; every stage but triage needs `workspace`. A kind left out is empty.",
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "item": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/item"
        },
        "discussion": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/discussion"
        },
        "notes": {
          "$comment": "The note of the request that started the stage, \"\" without one.",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "plan": {
          "$comment": "The approved plan, null without one.",
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ]
        },
        "previousPlan": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/previousPlan"
        },
        "checks": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/checks"
        },
        "linked": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "$ref": "#/$defs/linked"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ]
        },
        "evidence": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/evidence"
        },
        "parts": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "$ref": "#/$defs/parts"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ]
        },
        "diff": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/diff"
        },
        "workspace": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/workspace"
        }
      },
      "required": []
    },
    "item": {
      "$comment": "The work item: its text, its change when it has one, and what the change did outside the plan.",
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "id": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/number"
        },
        "title": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "body": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "change": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "$ref": "#/$defs/number"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ]
        },
        "person": {
          "$comment": "A change a person made, reviewed as its own work item, with no plan.",
          "type": "boolean"
        },
        "outsidePlan": {
          "$comment": "What the implement round did outside the plan, as it wrote it.",
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ]
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "id",
        "title",
        "body"
      ]
    },
    "entry": {
      "$comment": "One entry of a discussion, oldest first. The host leaves out what nobody it trusts wrote, and commands without a note.",
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "id": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/number"
        },
        "author": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "at": {
          "$ref": "../common.schema.json#/$defs/time"
        },
        "text": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "kind": {
          "$comment": "A person's comment, a note on a command, which only some stages read, or the answers a policy gave for the people who decide.",
          "enum": [
            "comment",
            "note",
            "answers"
          ]
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "id",
        "author",
        "at",
        "text",
        "kind"
      ]
    },
    "discussion": {
      "$comment": "The discussion on the work item and on its change, and what people said on the change's version.",
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "item": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "$ref": "#/$defs/entry"
          }
        },
        "change": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "$ref": "#/$defs/entry"
          }
        },
        "said": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "$ref": "#/$defs/said"
          }
        }
      },
      "required": []
    },
    "previousPlan": {
      "$comment": "The latest plan, which a new plan revises.",
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "text": {
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ]
        },
        "before": {
          "$comment": "How many entries of the item's discussion came before it.",
          "type": "integer"
        },
        "profile": {
          "$comment": "The profile it used, which triage reads.",
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ]
        }
      },
      "required": []
    },
    "check": {
      "$comment": "A check's result with the end of its output and earlier lines that report a failure.",
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "name": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "run": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "passed": {
          "type": "boolean"
        },
        "exitCode": {
          "type": [
            "integer",
            "null"
          ]
        },
        "output": {
          "$comment": "The end of its output, at most the last 12000 characters.",
          "type": "string",
          "maxLength": 12000
        },
        "failureLines": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "maxItems": 20
        },
        "outputCut": {
          "type": "boolean"
        },
        "shard": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "skipped": {
          "$comment": "The version it passed on, when it did not run again.",
          "type": "string"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "name",
        "run",
        "passed"
      ]
    },
    "required": {
      "$comment": "A required check of the host's CI that failed, so the accept was refused.",
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "name": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "url": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "commands": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "type": "string"
          }
        },
        "tests": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "type": "string"
          }
        }
      },
      "required": []
    },
    "checks": {
      "$comment": "The results of the checks: in a fix round the last recorded, in a review this round's. `diagnose` holds the checks a diagnosis round looks into.",
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "results": {
          "type": [
            "array",
            "null"
          ],
          "items": {
            "$ref": "#/$defs/check"
          }
        },
        "required": {
          "type": [
            "array",
            "null"
          ],
          "items": {
            "$ref": "#/$defs/required"
          }
        },
        "diagnose": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "name": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "signature": {
                "type": "string"
              }
            },
            "required": [
              "name",
              "signature"
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "required": []
    },
    "said": {
      "$comment": "What a person said on the change's version: a review with its state, or a comment on a line.",
      "anyOf": [
        {
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {
            "kind": {
              "const": "review"
            },
            "id": {
              "anyOf": [
                {
                  "$ref": "#/$defs/number"
                },
                {
                  "type": "null"
                }
              ]
            },
            "author": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "state": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "text": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          "required": [
            "kind",
            "author",
            "state",
            "text"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {
            "kind": {
              "const": "comment"
            },
            "id": {
              "anyOf": [
                {
                  "$ref": "#/$defs/number"
                },
                {
                  "type": "null"
                }
              ]
            },
            "author": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "path": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "line": {
              "type": "integer"
            },
            "text": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          "required": [
            "kind",
            "author",
            "path",
            "line",
            "text"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "linkedText": {
      "$comment": "A text the item links to: a comment, the engine's plan, or the text of an item or a change.",
      "anyOf": [
        {
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {
            "kind": {
              "enum": [
                "comment",
                "plan"
              ]
            },
            "id": {
              "$ref": "#/$defs/number"
            },
            "author": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "at": {
              "$ref": "../common.schema.json#/$defs/time"
            },
            "on": {
              "anyOf": [
                {
                  "$ref": "#/$defs/number"
                },
                {
                  "type": "null"
                }
              ]
            },
            "text": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          "required": [
            "kind",
            "id",
            "author",
            "at",
            "text"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {
            "kind": {
              "const": "item"
            },
            "id": {
              "$ref": "#/$defs/number"
            },
            "author": {
              "type": [
                "string",
                "null"
              ]
            },
            "title": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "change": {
              "type": "boolean"
            },
            "nexkit": {
              "type": "boolean"
            },
            "text": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          "required": [
            "kind",
            "id",
            "text"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "above": {
      "$comment": "An item a part was split from.",
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "id": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/number"
        },
        "title": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "body": {
          "$comment": "Null when the host did not read its text.",
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ]
        },
        "discussion": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "$ref": "#/$defs/entry"
          }
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "id",
        "title",
        "body",
        "discussion"
      ]
    },
    "linked": {
      "$comment": "What the item refers to and the agent cannot open itself.",
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "texts": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "$ref": "#/$defs/linkedText"
          }
        },
        "chain": {
          "$comment": "The items the item was split from, nearest first.",
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "$ref": "#/$defs/above"
          }
        },
        "notRead": {
          "$comment": "Each link the host did not read, and why, in its words; the host bounds how many it lists.",
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "type": "string"
          }
        }
      },
      "required": []
    },
    "run": {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "id": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/number"
        },
        "url": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "files": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "path": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "missing": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "count": {
                "type": "string"
              }
            },
            "required": [
              "path"
            ]
          }
        },
        "missing": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "type": "string"
          }
        },
        "workflow": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "branch": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "passedSince": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "object",
              "properties": {
                "id": {
                  "$ref": "#/$defs/number"
                },
                "sha": {
                  "type": "string"
                },
                "url": {
                  "type": "string"
                }
              },
              "required": [
                "id"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "id",
        "url",
        "files",
        "missing"
      ]
    },
    "ciEvidence": {
      "$comment": "What the CI runs the item names left, downloaded outside the working tree.",
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "folder": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "runs": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "$ref": "#/$defs/run"
          }
        },
        "leftOut": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "type": "string"
          }
        },
        "skipped": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "type": "string"
          }
        },
        "keeps": {
          "$comment": "The most bytes a round keeps of the runs.",
          "type": "integer"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "folder",
        "runs",
        "keeps"
      ]
    },
    "resultsEvidence": {
      "$comment": "The result files the failing checks kept, downloaded outside the working tree.",
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "folder": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "checks": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "name": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "run": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "folder": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "paths": {
                "type": "array",
                "items": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {
                    "path": {
                      "type": "string"
                    },
                    "folder": {
                      "type": "boolean"
                    },
                    "files": {
                      "type": "integer"
                    }
                  },
                  "required": [
                    "path",
                    "folder",
                    "files"
                  ]
                }
              },
              "leftOut": {
                "type": "integer"
              }
            },
            "required": [
              "name",
              "run",
              "folder",
              "paths"
            ]
          }
        },
        "keeps": {
          "$comment": "The most bytes of result files one check job keeps, and each of several.",
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {
            "one": {
              "type": "integer"
            },
            "several": {
              "type": "integer"
            }
          },
          "required": [
            "one",
            "several"
          ]
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "folder",
        "checks",
        "keeps"
      ]
    },
    "evidence": {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "ci": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "$ref": "#/$defs/ciEvidence"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ]
        },
        "results": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "$ref": "#/$defs/resultsEvidence"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "required": []
    },
    "parts": {
      "$comment": "The earlier parts of the same split that a part relies on, oldest first.",
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "parent": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/number"
        },
        "parts": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "id": {
                "$ref": "#/$defs/number"
              },
              "title": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "state": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "body": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "plan": {
                "type": [
                  "string",
                  "null"
                ]
              }
            },
            "required": [
              "id",
              "title",
              "state",
              "body"
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "parent",
        "parts"
      ]
    },
    "diff": {
      "$comment": "The change, from the host's workspace. `merging` is the version of the base a fix round merges in and the files it conflicts in. `merged` is the merge of the base that the newest fix record in `state.rounds.fixes` made, the round a review follows.",
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "base": {
          "$comment": "What the change goes onto, such as a branch.",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "text": {
          "$comment": "The change against its base. At most 80001 characters: the prompt shows 80000 and says so when there are more, so the host sends no more.",
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ],
          "maxLength": 80001
        },
        "since": {
          "$comment": "The change since the version the last review read; null when the host cannot show it. At most 80001 characters: the prompt shows 80000 and says so when there are more, so the host sends no more.",
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ],
          "maxLength": 80001
        },
        "merging": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "object",
              "properties": {
                "commit": {
                  "type": [
                    "string",
                    "null"
                  ]
                },
                "files": {
                  "type": "array",
                  "items": {
                    "type": "string"
                  }
                }
              },
              "required": [
                "commit",
                "files"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sides": {
          "$comment": "In the files a merge of the base in this run's fix round conflicted in: the base's changes, then the change's, each at most 20001 characters; null when the host cannot show them.",
          "type": [
            "array",
            "null"
          ],
          "maxItems": 2,
          "items": {
            "type": "string",
            "maxLength": 20001
          }
        },
        "merged": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "object",
              "properties": {
                "head": {
                  "$comment": "The version the round started from.",
                  "type": [
                    "string",
                    "null"
                  ]
                },
                "base": {
                  "$comment": "The version of the base it merged in.",
                  "type": "string"
                },
                "conflicts": {
                  "type": [
                    "array",
                    "null"
                  ],
                  "items": {
                    "type": "string"
                  }
                }
              },
              "required": [
                "base"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "base"
      ]
    },
    "workspace": {
      "$comment": "What the agent's workspace gives it: the checks it can run and the paths only a person changes.",
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "checks": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "name": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "run": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "slow": {
                "type": "boolean"
              },
              "shards": {
                "type": "object",
                "properties": {
                  "max": {
                    "type": "integer"
                  }
                },
                "required": [
                  "max"
                ]
              }
            },
            "required": [
              "name",
              "run"
            ]
          }
        },
        "protectedPaths": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "type": "string"
          }
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "checks",
        "protectedPaths"
      ]
    },
    "words": {
      "$comment": "The host's words, as its people see them, which the prompts of the stages use in place of any host's own. Each is a string of at most 200 characters, and every field is required, as the host's own text and outside the `<untrusted>` tags: a host builds them only from its own fixed text and ids, never from what people wrote. `itemKind` and `changeKind` are nouns the prompts use in rules, such as \"the issue's scope\"; `itemKinds` is the plural, which cannot be made from the noun. A template breaks a line inside `item` and `changeKind`, which the engine does at their last space. The engine refuses a stage's prompt without `words` and names the missing field; a call with `unfit` needs none.",
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "item": {
          "$comment": "The work item in a sentence, with its id, such as \"GitHub issue #5\".",
          "type": "string",
          "maxLength": 200
        },
        "itemHeading": {
          "$comment": "The work item as the heading of its text, such as \"Issue #5\".",
          "type": "string",
          "maxLength": 200
        },
        "itemKind": {
          "$comment": "The noun for a work item, such as \"issue\".",
          "type": "string",
          "maxLength": 200
        },
        "itemKinds": {
          "$comment": "The plural of `itemKind`, such as \"issues\".",
          "type": "string",
